     37  ce07				   AWARD_FIRST_SINK_AND_RECORD_POOL_BALL
     38  ce07							; First-sink path. The Deluxe helper compares this ball with the spoken call.
     39  ce07							; A match replaces the normal scaled 250 points (playfield value 2,500) with
     40  ce07							; the active player's advancing Called ball score; a non-match retains 250.
     41  ce07							; Both awards use the active playfield double/triple multiplier. The original
     42  ce07							; code then records the selected ball bit in 10C3 and starts its effects.
