   1838  dd71							; numbered called-ball lamp. Recording the ID whose XOR is currently applied
   1839  dd71							; lets the next edge restore the original shadow state before changing calls or
   1840  dd71							; ending the flash. Finally, mask every ball already recorded in 10C3 out of
   1841  dd71							; the active player's numbered-target bank. This prevents the original lamp
   1842  dd71							; state from turning a collected called ball steadily on after its XOR overlay
   1843  dd71							; is removed. Entry X is 103A; preserve X and B for C1B3 onward.
