    208  f38c							; Apply the pending score in 0094-0099 to the active player's displayed score
    209  f38c							; over successive main-loop passes. Deluxe shifts every canonical queue class
    210  f38c							; down one decimal place: 10 becomes 1, 100 becomes 10, and so on. This uses
    211  f38c							; the formerly fixed-zero ones digit and extends the effective old-score range
    212  f38c							; to 99,999,990 while preserving all relative rule values and multipliers.
